{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11206030","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11206030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1120603001:0":{"text":"영령 카스트의 보물이 어디에 있는지 어서 말해!","source_cn":"说，英灵卡斯特的宝藏在哪？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8031B5DC35DA2F7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120603002:0":{"text":"머리 굴리지 말고, 어서 말해!","source_cn":"快说，别想着逃跑！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DE76C6B73FD25EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120603003:1":{"text":"아니, 제발 제 얘기 좀 들어주세요… 보물은 없다니까요… 맹세할게요! 제가 지어낸 이야기라고요…","source_cn":"不，你们听、听我说……真的没有什么宝藏……我发誓！那…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8922266346CD9C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120603004:1":{"text":"뭐야? 하, 얘기 안 한다 이거지.","source_cn":"编的故事？嘿，你倒是挺嘴硬的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC3CD6719E4A2A93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120603005:1":{"text":"똑바로 얘기 안 하면 여기 네 형제 사막에 묻어버린다?","source_cn":"这是你兄弟吧？你要是不说实话……我就把他捆起来丢进荒漠里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x137560F31584DD2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120603006:1":{"text":"모래바람, 독충, 땡볕에서 과연 얼마나 버틸 수 있을까?","source_cn":"荒漠、风沙、毒虫、烈日……你猜猜他能活多久？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BB03D391D8AA731","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120603007:1":{"text":"아, 안돼! 제발요, 진짜 부탁드려요. 보물 따위는 진짜 몰라요…","source_cn":"不……不要！求你们，求求你了，我……我真的不知道什么宝...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB980254F4E8D1C7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120603008:1":{"text":"형님, 얘기 안 하는데요! 그냥 묻을까요?","source_cn":"老大，他还嘴硬！别跟他废话了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x333C85AA9893AD4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120603009:1":{"text":"아니, 잠깐만요! 사, 살려주세요!","source_cn":"……别……别动手！我……救命！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BFBE61D2DD0A7EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1120603009":{"text":"아니, 잠깐만요! 사, 살려주세요!","source_cn":"……别……别动手！我……救命！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BFBE61D2DD0A7EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1120603010:1":{"text":"누구냐?!","source_cn":"什么人？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x920EB13E68F3414E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1120603011:1":{"text":"어? 저 햄스터! 저게 보물을 탐지해내는 트레져 햄스터야!","source_cn":"嗯？我认得那两只仓鼠！那是可以勘探宝藏所在地的寻宝仓鼠！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x965AB4419C5999E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1120603012:1":{"text":"큭큭, 드디어 트레져 헌터 패거리가 납셨군!","source_cn":"嘿嘿，不错，没想到这俩宝藏猎人的同伙自己凑上来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA19503D979F5E5FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1120603012":{"text":"큭큭, 드디어 트레져 헌터 패거리가 납셨군!","source_cn":"嘿嘿，不错，没想到这俩宝藏猎人的同伙自己凑上来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA19503D979F5E5FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1120603013:1":{"text":"난 오지랖 넓은 놈이 제일 싫더라. 네가 죽음을 자처하니... 소원을 들어주지! 소식을 알아내는 데에 한 놈만 있으면 돼!","source_cn":"嘴硬又喜欢多管闲事的家伙最可恨——既然这样，那就干掉你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x800AF5B53E4A5C1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:17:0:1":{"text":"치피와 해미는 트레져 햄스터가 아니야","source_cn":"满满和漫漫不是寻宝仓鼠","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9DC0D7197D4A5948","variant_status":"runtim